@page "/projects/autonomous-robotics"
@using website.Data

<div class="bg-gray-900 min-h-screen text-white p-8">
    <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto">
        <!-- Hero Section -->
        <div class="text-center mb-12">
            <h1 class="text-5xl font-bold mb-4 bg-gradient-to-r from-blue-400 to-purple-500 bg-clip-text text-transparent">
                Autonomous Robot Navigation & Object Detection
            </h1>
            <p class="text-xl text-gray-300 max-w-3xl mx-auto">
                Advanced ROS2-based autonomous robotics project implementing computer vision, motion planning, and intelligent navigation for TurtleBot3 simulation with sophisticated exploration strategies and precision object interaction.
            </p>
        </div>

        <!-- Project Overview -->
        <div class="bg-gray-800 rounded-lg p-8 mb-8 border border-gray-700">
            <div class="flex items-center mb-6">
                <div class="bg-blue-600 rounded-full p-3 mr-4">
                    <i class="fas fa-robot text-white text-xl"></i>
                </div>
                <div>
                    <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white">Project Overview</h2>
                    <p class="text-gray-400">Intelligent Systems and Robotics Coursework</p>
                </div>
            </div>
            <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
                This comprehensive autonomous robotics project demonstrates the integration of multiple AI and robotics technologies
                to create an intelligent system capable of exploration, object detection, and precision navigation. Built using ROS2
                and deployed in Gazebo simulation, the project showcases advanced concepts including SLAM (Simultaneous Localization
                and Mapping), computer vision, and autonomous decision-making.
            </p>
            <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed">
                The robot autonomously explores environments, detects RGB colored objects using sophisticated computer vision algorithms,
                and performs precision approach maneuvers to reach target objects with sub-meter accuracy.
            </p>
        </div>

        <!-- Core Features -->
        <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-8 mb-8">
            <!-- Autonomous Navigation -->
            <div class="bg-gray-800 rounded-lg p-6 border border-gray-700 hover:border-blue-500/50 transition-all duration-300">
                <div class="flex items-center mb-4">
                    <div class="bg-purple-600 rounded-full p-2 mr-3">
                        <i class="fas fa-route text-white"></i>
                    </div>
                    <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-white">Autonomous Navigation System</h3>
                </div>
                <ul class="text-gray-300 space-y-2">
                    <li>• <strong>ROS2 Integration:</strong> Modern robotics framework with Nav2 stack</li>
                    <li>• <strong>Motion Planning:</strong> Autonomous exploration with waypoint navigation</li>
                    <li>• <strong>SLAM Integration:</strong> Real-time mapping and localization</li>
                    <li>• <strong>Obstacle Avoidance:</strong> Dynamic path planning with laser scans</li>
                    <li>• <strong>State Machine Control:</strong> Robust behavior management</li>
                    <li>• <strong>Precision Positioning:</strong> Sub-meter accuracy for target approach</li>
                </ul>
            </div>

            <!-- Computer Vision -->
            <div class="bg-gray-800 rounded-lg p-6 border border-gray-700 hover:border-blue-500/50 transition-all duration-300">
                <div class="flex items-center mb-4">
                    <div class="bg-green-600 rounded-full p-2 mr-3">
                        <i class="fas fa-eye text-white"></i>
                    </div>
                    <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-white">Computer Vision & Detection</h3>
                </div>
                <ul class="text-gray-300 space-y-2">
                    <li>• <strong>Real-time RGB Detection:</strong> OpenCV-based color classification</li>
                    <li>• <strong>HSV Color Processing:</strong> Robust detection under varying lighting</li>
                    <li>• <strong>Contour Analysis:</strong> Precise object boundary detection</li>
                    <li>• <strong>Visual Feedback:</strong> Live camera feed with tracking overlay</li>
                    <li>• <strong>Distance Estimation:</strong> Contour area-based proximity measurement</li>
                    <li>• <strong>Multi-target Tracking:</strong> Simultaneous detection of multiple objects</li>
                </ul>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Technical Architecture -->
