                    <p class="text-gray-300 text-sm">
                        Main control node managing state coordination, sensor integration, and
                        high-level behavior orchestration across all system components.
                    </p>
                </div>

                <div class="bg-gray-800 rounded-lg p-4">
                    <h4 class="font-semibold text-green-400 mb-2">color_detector.py</h4>
                    <p class="text-gray-300 text-sm">
                        Computer vision module implementing HSV color space processing,
                        contour analysis, and real-time object tracking with visual feedback.
                    </p>
                </div>

                <div class="bg-gray-800 rounded-lg p-4">
                    <h4 class="font-semibold text-yellow-400 mb-2">motion_controller.py</h4>
                    <p class="text-gray-300 text-sm">
                        Low-level movement control with precise velocity management,
