                    </p>
                </div>

                <div class="bg-gray-800 rounded-lg p-4">
                    <h4 class="font-semibold text-orange-400 mb-2">exploration_strategy.py</h4>
                    <p class="text-gray-300 text-sm">
                        High-level navigation logic implementing waypoint navigation,
                        systematic scanning, and intelligent state transitions.
                    </p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

